---
import ConverterPage from '../components/ConverterPage.astro';
---

<ConverterPage
  path="/mangal-to-devlys"
  lede="Paste Mangal (Unicode) Hindi on the left and get DevLys 010 on the right, once the DevLys layout has been verified."
>
  <h2>What is holding this up</h2>
  <p>
    DevLys 010 and Kruti Dev 010 share most of their keyboard layout, so it is
    tempting to reuse one map for both. Mostly that works, and the places it does
    not are the dangerous part: a handful of keys differ, and text converted with
    the wrong one comes out looking like correct Hindi with a few letters
    silently changed.
  </p>
  <p>
    Until that diff is done against real DevLys files, this page stays off. The
    <a href="/mangal-to-kruti-dev">Mangal to Kruti Dev converter</a> is finished
    and tested if Kruti Dev will do.
  </p>
</ConverterPage>
